falls on a weekend or a public holiday, the cut-off moves to the last working day before it.\\n\\n## What to submit\\n\\nSubmit one file per team, listing every hourly worker with hours and the cost centre the hours are charged to. Blank rows are rejected by the upload page.\\n\\n## Corrections\\n\\nA correction submitted before the cut-off replaces the earlier file entirely. After the cut-off, corrections go to the payroll inbox as a written request and are applied to the following month.\\n\\n## Escalation\\n\\nIf the upload page is unavailable in the hour before the cut-off, email the payroll team and keep the file. Do not send totals in the body of an email.\\n\\n## Paper timesheets\\n\\nTeams without terminal access may send paper timesheets to the payroll office by internal post, to arrive no later than the cut-off.\",\"decisions\":[{\"slot\":\"title\",\"candidates\":[{\"text\":\"# Payroll Submission Deadlines (2026 Schedule)\",\"document\":\"source_a.md\"},{\"text\":\"# Payroll Submission Deadlines (2025 Schedule)\",\"document\":\"source_b.md\"}],\"chosen\":\"# Payroll Submission Deadlines (2026 Schedule)\",\"reason\":\"Base document's title kept; it is the current schedule.\"},{\"slot\":\"monthly cut-off time and date\",\"candidates\":[{\"text\":\"Totals must be submitted by 12:00 on the 18th of the month.\",\"document\":\"source_a.md\"},{\"text\":\"Totals must be submitted by 15:00 on the 20th of the month.\",\"document\":\"source_b.md\"}],\"chosen\":\"Totals must be submitted by 12:00 on the 18th of the month.\",\"reason\":\"Conflicting cut-off values; base's 2026 schedule chosen.\"},{\"slot\":\"weekend/holiday cut-off adjustment\",\"candidates\":[{\"text\":\"If the 18th falls on a weekend or a public holiday, the cut-off moves to the last working day before it.\",\"document\":\"source_a.md\"},{\"text\":\"If the 20th falls on a weekend, the cut-off moves to the following Monday.\",\"document\":\"source_b.md\"}],\"chosen\":\"If the 18th falls on a weekend o